      <img src="/about/evan-amman-wide.jpg" width="1320" height="1057" alt="Evan, in a cap and glasses, smiling and pouring coffee from a brass dallah on a sunlit café terrace, with Amman’s stone buildings behind" />
      <figcaption>Enjoying “Bedouin Coffee” in Amman, Jordan</figcaption>
